  "title": "Yaqub al-Mansur",
  "summary": "Abu Yusuf Yaqub al-Mansur was the third Almohad caliph, reigning from 1184 to 1199. He defeated a Castilian army at Alarcos in 1195, which temporarily halted their advance into Muslim Spain. A translated account dates the battle to Wednesday 9 Sha'ban 591 AH, equal to 19 July 1195.",
